B.aqr=new A.ey("Who We Are","Saksham Foundation is a registered charitable organisation headquartered in Bengaluru, Karnataka. Founded in 2008, we work across education, child welfare, healthcare, and community development to uplift underserved communities across South India.")
B.aqC=new A.ey("Our Mission","To empower every child and family we serve with access to quality education, healthcare, and livelihood support \u2014 building a more equitable society, one community at a time.")
B.aqp=new A.ey("Our Impact","15,000+ children supported  \xb7  \u20b98.2 Cr+ raised  \xb7  48 partner NGOs  \xb7  12 districts reached\n\nEvery rupee donated is tracked, accounted for, and directed toward maximum beneficiary impact.")
B.aqD=new A.ey("Certifications & Registrations","\u2726 80G & 12A Tax Exemption\n\u2726 FCRA Licensed (Ministry of Home Affairs)\n\u2726 CSR-1 Registered (MCA)\n\u2726 GiveIndia Verified NGO\n\u2726 ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management")
B.aqE=new A.ey("This App","The Saksham Admin App is a purpose-built tool for staff and volunteers to manage donors, track donations, monitor student progress, and generate impact reports \u2014 all from a single mobile platform.")
B.aqw=new A.ey("Contact Us","Saksham Foundation\nNo. 42, NGO Campus, HSR Layout\nBengaluru \u2013 560067, Karnataka\n\nEmail: info@sakshamfoundation.org\nPhone: +91 80 2345 6789\nWebsite: www.sakshamfoundation.org")
B.a38=s([B.aqr,B.aqC,B.aqp,B.aqD,B.aqE,B.aqw],t.HP)
